The real-PLC (Family0) seed and key derivation in `src/legacy/family0/` (`curve.rs`,
`present.rs`, `seed.rs`) and the challenge fingerprint in `src/legacy/fingerprint.rs` follow
gijzelaerr/s7commplus (https://github.com/gijzelaerr/s7commplus,
`s7commplus/v1_session_key/real_plc/`), which identified HarpoS7's Family0 transforms as an
x-only ECDH and a PRESENT-80 variant, and its fingerprint as a fixed SPN. The chained
response digests in `src/legacy/digest.rs` (`ResponseDigests`) and their OpenSSL test
vectors follow its `s7commplus/_fragment_hmac.py` and
`tests/fixtures/s7commplus/legacy_fragment_hmac.json`. The TIA Portal frames in
`tests/golden_tia.rs` come from its `tests/fixtures/golden_tia_online_session_20260915.py`.
